### Read a complete explainable issue recommendation
# @name getIssueRecommendation
GET {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/issues/{{owner}}/{{repository}}/{{issueNumber}}?skills=Go&skills=React
Accept: application/json
X-Request-ID: httpyac-issue-detail

### Observe one public issue state without copying its content
# @name observeGitHubReference
POST {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/github/references/observe
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-ID: httpyac-reference-observe

{
  "kind": "issue",
  "owner": "{{owner}}",
  "repositoryName": "{{repository}}",
  "number": {{issueNumber}}
}

### Repeat issue detail to observe X-IssueScout-Cache
# @name getIssueRecommendationCached
GET {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/issues/{{owner}}/{{repository}}/{{issueNumber}}?skills=Go&skills=React
Accept: application/json
X-Request-ID: httpyac-issue-detail-cache-repeat

### [negative] Reject a non-numeric issue number before upstream I/O
# @name rejectInvalidIssueNumber
GET {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/issues/{{owner}}/{{repository}}/not-a-number
Accept: application/json
X-Request-ID: httpyac-issue-detail-invalid-number

### [negative] Reject an empty skill value
# @name rejectEmptyIssueSkill
GET {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/issues/{{owner}}/{{repository}}/{{issueNumber}}?skills=
Accept: application/json
X-Request-ID: httpyac-issue-detail-empty-skill
